title: "B280-olca-MCP"
type: software
abstract: >-
  A Model Context Protocol server that lets AI assistants build and
  calculate openLCA models only through olcaBASIC, so that life cycle
  assessment modelling rules are enforced in code rather than left to the
  assistant.
